From eb25531cffb1c32e66271107654dd83590c3606d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "qwen.ai[bot]" <qwenlm-intl@service.alibaba.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:12:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix tooltip not appearing on pattern markers by replacing raw
 mousemove with crosshair subscription

- src/components/CandlestickChart.tsx: Replaced container `mousemove` listener with `chart.subscribeCrosshairMove` to correctly align cursor coordinates with chart internal coordinate system; added fallback mousemove handler that accounts for canvas offset; implemented logic to aggregate multiple patterns per bar into a single marker and display combined names in tooltip.
- src/__tests__/unit/tooltip_hover.test.ts: Added new unit tests mocking `lightweight-charts` to verify tooltip visibility on marker hover, correct content rendering (pattern name/confidence), hiding behavior when moving away, and handling of multi-pattern bars.
- dist/index.html & .gitignore: Updated build artifacts hash reference and added `dist/` to ignore list to reflect recent changes.
